<title>USA: Lancer Orthodontics chairman dies.</title>
<headline>Lancer Orthodontics chairman dies.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MARCOS, Calif. 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lancer Orthodontics Inc said its chairman, Joseph Irani, has died from &quot;natural causes.&quot;</p>
<p>Lancer said Zackary Irani has been elected as the new chairman. It said the company's current management team will remain intact.</p>
